    {
      "id": "22",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第1节 背景",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "今天我们演示如何给fay配置本地大语言模型。在人人养虾的今年，线上模型严重超负荷，远远慢于数字人正常对话的要求（五十 token 每秒以上），故咱们需要一个本地的对话模型。如果你有一张3060以上的显卡，请跟着我一步步来搭建这个本地模型，并完成与fay的对接。以windows系统为样板，准备好了的话，咱们就开始吧。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第2节 安装lm studio",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "首先，咱们到lm studio的官网下载一个安装包并完成安装。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "代码/文案",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\nhttps://lmstudio.ai\n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第3节 下载大语言模型",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "在lm studio应用中搜索qwen 3.5 9b并点击下载，等待下载完成。如果你的电脑配置并不高可以选择qwen 3.5 4b。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第4节 下载embedding模型",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "39",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "以同样的方式下载qwen 3 embedding模型。等待下载完成。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "40",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第5节 加载模型",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "41",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "42",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "43",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "两个模型都下载完成后，进行开发者栏目（左侧第2个），通过“load model”按钮，分别加载刚才下载的两个模型。此时记得选择弹窗下方的“允许多模型加载”。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "44",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第6节 开启内网通讯",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "45",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "46",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "47",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "在\"server setting\"这里打开“serve on local network”，便可以在内网上实现模型请求了。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "48",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第7节 关闭模型的Thinking模式",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "49",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "50",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "51",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "选中qwen 3.5 9b 模型，在右侧的inference栏中关闭模式，便可以在模型输出阶段关闭思考内容，以更快获得回复。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "52",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第8节 在fay上完成配置",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "53",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "54",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "55",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "在fay的源码目录找到system.conf文件，如果没有可以把system.conf.bak重命名过来，并配置图中的四项。如果你没有在lm studio上设定key，请随意填写。若你使用的是fay release版，可在安装过程中依引导完成这四项的配置。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "56",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第9节 远程访问模型",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "57",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "讲稿",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "58",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "若你和我一样，算力主机在异地，又没有ip专线网络，可以到ngrok.cc购买穿透服务，把lm studio服务端口映射到互联网。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
